cormuj is the name of corwin's main pattern in the [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amber_Diceless_Roleplaying_Game|Amber rpg] setting. mungojelly is the game master. The in game thari language is actually lojban. 

((cormuj/blazda|blazda)) is the big house.

((cormuj/lak|lak)) , and ((cormuj/raijatn|raijatn)) are player characers in the game that are children of corwin.